# What the generated engine carries, one path per line.
#
# Explicit on purpose. Guessing a dependency by reading prose is what broke
# four times on the markdown parser check, and a generator that reads the
# skill's own sentences would inherit that failure. If a skill starts citing
# a file, this list is where it gets added; scripts/build-engines.py refuses
# a citation that is not here.
#
# <lang> is filled with the language the engine is built for.

references/interview-intents.md
references/style-taxonomy.md
references/formats.md
references/anchoring.md
references/platform.md
references/measure.md
references/sheet-artifact.md
locales/<lang>/interview.md
locales/<lang>/style.md
locales/<lang>/market.md
